\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-\uc2 Brazil  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  to sell up to $1 bln in spot  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  market\b0\par\par\uc2 287 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2020\par 23:46\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2020 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 (Adds context)\par \par \uc2 BRASILIA/SAO PAULO, March 6 (Reuters) - \uc2 Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will auction up to $1 billion in the spot \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Monday, it said on its website on Friday, marking its first \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  selling dollar reserves outright since November.\par \par \uc2 The announcement follows the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's sale of $5 billion worth of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swap contracts this week in an effort to slow the sharp depreciation of the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , amid calls from investors to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the spot market, too.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the real, hit a record-low on Friday, at 4.67 per dollar, and has lost more than 13% this year \u8212\'20\'14 one of the worst-performing \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the world \u8212\'20\'14 as the country's economic growth and interest rate outlooks have dipped sharply.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's return to the spot market, dipping into some $360 billion of international reserves, comes amid surging market volatility, which has been linked with recent escalations in the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Implied one-month and three-month dollar/real volatility rose on Friday above the level when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  last sold \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves in November, fast approaching levels seen in August, when policymakers sold dollars in the spot market for the first time in 10 years.\par \par \uc2 After the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2 's emergency interest rate cut this week, \uc2 Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it was monitoring financial conditions as coronavirus fears hammered local markets and triggered a wave of downward revisions of growth forecasts. (Reporting by Jamie McGeever, Marcela Ayres and Jose de Castro Editing by Brad Haynes and Leslie Adler)\par \par \uc2 Released: 2020-3-9T22:46:38.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020200306eg3604iqe\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
