\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 The dollar rose but does not reach: the peso is delayed against a devalued real\b0\par\par\uc2 420 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2020\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BCRA) repeated its modus operandi and for the tenth consecutive wheel raised the price of its token by US$50 million at MULC. The six-cent hike pushed the wholesaler to $62.42.\par \par \uc2 This represented a weight depreciation of just 0.10%, against a much larger collapse of the rest of the region's \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The fall of the real, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the main trading partner, was over 1.5% despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market.\par \par \uc2 The retail dollar remained unchanged at $64, while the blue dollar remained at $77.75. The solidarity dollar retreated to $83.73, after playing the $83.90 on Wednesday and being on the brink of $84 on Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 The traded volume again showed a decrease, to the spot segment moved US$ 197,130 million, with us $4 million in the foreign ministry sector.\par \par \par \par \par \par \uc2 "The real depreciation rate is much higher than ours. In the bilateral relationship we are getting behind against our main trading partner," warned Fernando Camusso of Rafaela Capital.\par \par \uc2 In dialogue with The Chronist, he noted that "if this black swan that is the coronavirus is prolonged over time, it is an additional factor that will put pressure on the exchange rate".\par \par \uc2 "The problem is the covert distortion that is generated with a downward interest rate. If there was no cepo, that would translate into a dollar rise. As this is a frozen economy, the pressure on the exchange rate and prices is increasing," he said.\par \par \uc2 From ABC's Exchange Market they agreed that the region's depreciation situation is a short-term problem: "We are out of the context of the international \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, especially those emerging from neighboring countries, as a sharp devaluation recorded in all markets including the US dollar index itself against the basket of strong foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell to 96.71%, a 0.58% today."\par \par \uc2 Andthe \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2  carried out two \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the dollar gained strength again and broke record after record.\par \par \uc2 Brazil's economy minister, \uc2 Paulo Guedes\uc2 ,admitted that the exchange rate is "at a higher level," albeit fluctuating.\par \par \uc2 In statements to journalists, he noted that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would maintain market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "The exchange rate fluctuation is now at a higher level, but it is a floating rate.\u160\'00\'A0I don't believe in capital flight," he said to the newspaper Valor Econ\u243\'00\'F3mico.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020200305eg35005pv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
