\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  of Brazil\uc2 , to the rescue of the real slob\b0\par\par\uc2 431 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Februar 2020\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to shore up its weakened \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  after it fell to another all-time low in its parity with the dollar and consolidated its ranking as the worst-performing emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  this year.\par \par \uc2 m\{690633\}The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold $1 billion (mdd) in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps on Thursday as the country sought to avoid further depreciation in the real.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  came from a series of record lows in its dollar parity for Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which records a real drop of 6.9 percent so far this year. That makes it the worst-performing \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  among the top 24 emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  ranked by Bloomberg.\par \par \uc2 Analysts attributed the slippage in part to cutting the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's benchmark rate to an all-time low of 4.25 percent last week, although it indicated that it would delay further easing until the effects could be assessed of the current stimulus. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  became caught up in a similar situation in November, when, after a series of interest rate cuts, it had to sell dollars to sustain the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 After Thursday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was able to strengthen almost 1 percent to reach a parity of 4.32 reais per dollar.\par \par \uc2 According to Dirk Willer, head of emerging market strategy at \uc2 Citigroup\uc2 , Thursday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  stands in stark contrast to the stance taken by certain government officials earlier this week. Economy Minister \uc2 Paulo Guedes\uc2  said he was not concerned about the real weakness, while head of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 Roberto Campos Neto\uc2 , said he was comfortable with the current depreciation as it was accompanied by inflation expectations Stable.\par \par \uc2 The market was "testing" officials, explained Felipe Camargo, economist for Latin America at Oxford Economics. "It made sense for them to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."\par \par \uc2 Still, because the government did not point to a comprehensive program to strengthen the real against the dollar, Willer clarified that this \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  "feels like a one-time," at least for now.\par \par \uc2 As long as real fluctuations are not too volatile, the weaker \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  could support Brazil's economy, which weakened in recent months. "The best thing of all worlds for policymakers is to curb depreciation without big movements."\par \par \uc2 Key\par \par \uc2 Alert\par \par \uc2 Intensified coronavirus outbreak and growing concerns about the impact on global growth make the real one likely to remain under pressure.\par \par \uc2 Weakness\par \par \uc2 Most of Latin America's \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  are weakening, except for Mexico's, an Oxford Economics specialist said.\par \par \uc2 Confidence\par \par \uc2 Economic specialists believe that policy-making will continue to halt depreciation without large movements.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020200214eg2e00bls\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
