\par\par \b \uc2 EMERGING MARKETS-Brazil real leads Latam  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  higher, stocks pinned by jump in coronavirus cases\b0\par\par\uc2 561 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Februar 2020\par 16:31\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2020 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     * Brazilian real gains on \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  \par     * Argentina warns of 'deep debt restructuring' \par     * Chilean peso hit by lower copper prices\par     * Surge in coronavirus cases keeps investors risk averse\par \par     By Shreyashi Sanyal\par     Feb 13 (Reuters) - The Brazilian real led a charge among\par Latin American \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on Thursday when the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par announced a new \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  but stocks in the region came under\par pressure as the number of coronavirus deaths and infections\par surged in China. \par     The real hit a record low earlier in the session\par before reversing course to trade 0.8% higher to 4.3071 against\par the greenback after the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  sold $1 billion of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign\par exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  swap contracts on the spot market, its first\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  since late November.\par     \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Brazil\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  was hit by data on Wednesday which showed\par retail sales fell 0.1% in December, the first decline in eight\par months. The real has been pressured this year by slow overseas\par demand for Brazilian assets with interest rates at a record low.\par \par     "I'm sure many people in Brazil will be happy to see any\par brief relief but the bigger story is that the real is going to\par continue weakening," said \f28 \uc2 \f2 John Ashbourne\f28 \uc2 \f2 , senior emerging\par markets economist at Capital Economics. \par     MSCI's index for Latin American \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par rose 0.4%, while its index for equities fell\par 0.8%.\par     A surge in the number of coronavirus cases and deaths came\par as a shock to investors who were hoping the outbreak would soon\par come to a peak and as of Thursday, total deaths in China from\par the SARS-CoV-2 virus were 1,367, up 254 from the previous day.\par \par     "At this stage, it's still too early to tell whether or not\par Covid-19 is 'under control' or not. Especially given that the\par most surge in cases (due to a new counting methodology) shows\par that we don't really know the actual number of infected cases,"\par analysts at \f28 \uc2 \f2 Rabobank\f28 \uc2 \f2  wrote in a client note. \par     In Argentina, Economy Minister Martin Guzman said the\par government was willing to pay its debts but did not have the\par money to do so, warning of a "a deep debt restructuring" ahead.\par \par     Argentina's peso weakened against the dollar, while\par Argentine over the counter bonds open 2% lower.  \par     Commodity-linked \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  including the Chilean peso\par  and Colombia's peso also declined. Weakening oil\par prices hit Colombia's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , while Chile's peso was hurt by a\par drop in prices of copper, its main export. \par     Declines among stocks were led by Argentina's Merval\par with its 2.3% decline, while Sao Paolo stocks fell more\par than 1%.   \par     Latin American stock indexes and \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  at 1510 GMT\par    Stock indexes            Latest     Daily % change\par  MSCI Emerging Markets        1105.33           -0.39\par                                        \par  MSCI LatAm                   2787.49           -0.84\par                                        \par  Brazil Bovespa             115182.87           -1.28\par                                        \par  Mexico IPC                  45045.09           -0.65\par                                        \par  Chile IPSA                   4640.39           -0.59\par                                        \par  Argentina MerVal            39044.72          -2.232\par                                        \par  Colombia COLCAP              1656.81           -0.16\par                                        \par                                                      \par       \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2             Latest     Daily % change\par  Brazil real                   4.3203            0.66\par                                        \par  Mexico peso                  18.6337           -0.11\par                                        \par  Chile peso                     797.2           -0.90\par                                        \par  Colombia peso                 3389.5           -0.10\par                                        \par  Peru sol                       3.382           -0.12\par                                        \par  Argentina peso               61.3300           -0.16\par  (interbank)                           \par                                        \par  \par \par  (Reporting by Shreyashi Sanyal in Bengaluru; editing by Grant\par McCool)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Released: 2020-2-13T16:31:33.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020200213eg2d039ft\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
