\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  slows back from the dollar\b0\par\par\uc2 327 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Februar 2020\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BCB) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Thursday in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to stem the sinking of the real against the dollar, which during the week did not stop breaking its historical records.\par \par \uc2 The Green banknote, which was first listed above 4.30 reais on 7 February, closed at 4,352 on Wednesday and on Thursday reached 4,383 reais.\par \par \uc2 Following the BCB's swap \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the dollar lost momentum and was trading at 4,333 reais by 17H20 GMT.\par \par \uc2 Since the beginning of the year, the real had a depreciation of nearly 6% against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The devaluation of the real, analysts say, is linked to the sharp fall in the BCB's basic interest rate, which this month was cut to an all-time low of 4.25%, making places in Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  less attractive.\par \par \uc2 In that factor are uncertainties about the impacts of the newly emerged outbreak in China on the world economy.\par \par \uc2 Some commentators also link it to the negative impact of comments made Wednesday by the economy minister, ultra-liberal \uc2 Paulo Guedes\uc2 , who criticized previous situations in which the low dollar created a "damaging situation," with " everyone going to Disneyland, [even] domestic workers going to Disneyland."\par \par \uc2 President Jair Bolsonaro declared on Thursday morning that the dollar is "a little high," but that he would not seek to interfere in exchange policy.\par \par \uc2 Alex Agostini, chief economist at the consulting firm Austin Rating, thinks "the dollar can go up a little bit more" versus the real one.\par \par \uc2 The BCB could make other \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  "to try to somewhat ensure the direct effect of the dollar's rise on production costs," he said.\par \par \uc2 But "the effect of these \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  will depend on the market: if the market finds that the level is satisfactory, [\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ] can have any effect; if not, the next day you can show that it had no effect."\par \par \uc2 js7gm\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020200213eg2d0057r\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
