\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Jair Bolsonaro: "I hope there is an understanding of Trump and don't penalize us"\b0\par\par\uc2 608 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Dezember 2019\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 President \uc2 Jair Bolsonaro\uc2  said he does not see the US decision to reinstate tariffs on steel and aluminum imports made in Brazil and Argentina and assured that if necessary he will discuss the case with his colleague \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 , which surprised the Brazilian government.\par \par \uc2 "I'm going to talk to (economy minister) \uc2 Paulo Guedes\uc2 . If so, I'll call President \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 ," Bolsonaro told reporters.\par \par \uc2 "I don't see this as retaliation. I'll talk to him (with Trump) to see if he doesn't penalize us with the overtariff on the price of aluminum. Your argument on your \uc2 Twitter\uc2  is the problem of raw materials, our economy basically comes from raw materials, that's what we have. I hope there is an understanding of him,that he does not penalize us about it, and I am quite sure he will listen to us," Bolsonaro added.\par \par \uc2 Earlier, when consulted by journalists on the subject, he said: "I'm going to talk to Guedes today. Aluminum? I'm going to talk to \uc2 Paulo Guedes\uc2  now. I'm going to talk to \uc2 Paulo Guedes\uc2 . If that's the case, I'll call Trump. I have an open channel with him. I talk to \uc2 Paulo Guedes\uc2  and then I'll give an answer, so I don't have to back down."\par \par \uc2 Trump announced that he would immediately reinstate tariffs on steel and aluminum imports from Argentina and Brazil for heavy weight and actual depreciation, and mentioned damage to U.S. economic sectors from those devaluations that described as "massive."\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Brazilian Vice President General Hamilton Mourao reacted to President Trump's announcement by stating that his country does not artificially devalue the real \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Without referring specifically to the American representative, Mourao attributed Trump's announced decision to the geopolitical tension between the United States and China.\par \par \uc2 Speaking at an event organized by the powerful Federation of Industries of the State of St. Paul (FIESP), he assured that Trump's argument for the measure, in a reference to the depreciation of the real in the last month, "is not happening."\par \par \uc2 "That is characteristic of the geopolitical tension we are experiencing that generates protectionism. It is an anti-cyclical movement in relation to globalization," the government's number two said.\par \par \uc2 Mourao further considered that China's economic rise "opened up opportunities for countries like ours" in terms of exports, technological development, and infrastructure investment capture, so he called for "dealing with them (by China)" because "we need financing and the Chinese are willing to finance."\par \par \uc2 The tariffs levied by the United States on steel and aluminum in the two major Mercosur bloc countries had been cut in 2018,following an agreement to create import quotas without additional customs taxes in the event that US companies themselves reported raw material shortages in their own market.\par \par \uc2 At the time, the \uc2 US government\uc2  had considered imposing additional fees on Brazil, something that did not,however.\par \par \uc2 Known as Trump's decision, the dollar rose in \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2  to R$4,257,forcing the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  with spot \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  sales, lowering the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's price to R$4,229.\par \par \uc2 Guest reviews\par \par \uc2 TOPICS THAT APPEAR IN THIS NOTEJair Bolsonaroitemprop'"keywords">Donald TrumpGuest reviews\par \par \uc2 LOADING COMMENTS\par \par \uc2 Clar\u237\'00\'EDnTo comment you must activate your account by clicking on the email we sent you to the boxDidn't find the e-mail? Click here and we'll send it back to you.\par \par \uc2 I've already turned it on.Clar\u237\'00\'EDnTo comment on our notes please complete the following data.\par \par \uc2 LastnameSaveCancel\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020191202efc20044k\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
