\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Argentina expects signals from Brazil, where  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  to sell dollars to sustain real\b0\par\par\uc2 938 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 August 2019\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 (AFP)Asian markets opened with hikes and futures of the European and Wall Street stock exchanges were also in blue at midnight East, foreshadowing a good day for Monday on the world's stock exchanges and also for the dollar. But at the same time all eyes are on the publication of the minutes of the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  meeting in July, where two of its members refused to vote for low rates and others called for harsher cuts. These minutes may make clear the positions of the members of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the United States for the future. The chairing entity \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2  is distancing himself from Donald Trump, who claims a more forceful rate drop to devalue the dollar.\par \par \uc2 The most anticipated day of the week is Friday because the annual Jackson Hole economic policy symposium begins, at which the opening will speakPowell. While no one expects a remarkable clue as to the future of American interest rates at the September meeting, it will be listened to carefully.\par \par \uc2 What happens in the world to Argentina is vital because its markets are sensitive. Stronger dollar strength and a U.S. bond rise that means a country risk rise in emerging countries can mark the dollar's fate in Argentina, which is pending the renewal of fixed terms and the price of debt bonds. If people disbelieve local titles, and fixed deadlines, they'll become dollar hunters.\par \par \uc2 The role of the Stock Exchange is also key, to see if it can sustain the pace of hikes of the last week of last week. They were misleading ups: they responded to a small group of large-moving roles.\par \par \uc2 (NA)For now, the market is balancing after last week's coup because the fixed-term exit from the system was moderate and the drop in dollar deposits hovered around $600 million. In one week, reserves fell 3,406 million despite having moderate \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to contain the dollar. But the exit of the fixed deadlines is meaning a stone in the shoe.\par \par \uc2 As Monday is a holiday in Argentina, markets will see what decisions the new economy minister, Hern\u225\'00\'E1n Lacunza, will make, who pledged not to sacrifice reserves to sustain the dollar. That is to say that the only instrument you have left is the Liquidity Letters rate, which is already at an unbearable 74% annually. The inflation that awaits it will be very high because August will carry the devaluation of the end of July and will have to withstand the enormous political pressure of Kirchnerism that already acts as the successor to Macrism, despite the lack of october war.\par \par \uc2 Announced measures to revive VAT-elimination consumption for food and other stimulus of durable goods collide with interest rates and dollar instability. The vendor market operates on open invoices. That is, it sells in installments, but the price of the merchandise is put on the day the invoice is due according to the value of the dollar.\par \par \uc2 The trader and manufacturer act without reference prices and makes the market a price chaos. This week will have the renewal of assets in thetrades and price dispersion and inflation can be high. Not to be at risk of the lack of some products. Desperate measures never work. They have little time to get going. For example, by the October election a single salary will benefit from the lowering of the income tax.Hernan LacunzaDuring the last days of last week, increases in food were noticed, so the freezing price of naphthas compared to what happens around is an anecdote. The government lost control of the micro and macro economy. In fact, it can no longer meet the \uc2 IMF\uc2 's goals because when taxes fall to encourage consumption, numbers went offline. What happens with fixed deadlines, most of it expires a few days before the election, is key.\par \par \uc2 What can ease the market is that exporters reappear when they see a more predictable dollar, but it will all depend on the mood of the market next Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, in Kirchnerism they are showing signs of peace with entrepreneurs and cleaning up their image as an anti-market. For example, one sign that few know is that Carlos "el Chino" Zannini was excluded from all meetings by Alberto Fern\u225\'00\'E1ndez, who does not want him within his consultation group. He is bent on erasing hard Kirchnerism, although he met La C\u225\'00\'E1mpora raising his voice and promoting candidates for public office.\par \par \uc2 Nor should you despise the role of \uc2 Axel Kicillof\uc2 . He acts as a parallel economy minister and his friendship with \uc2 Guido Sandleris\uc2  has made him one of the negotiators of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy, although that is not his role because he must concentrate on his campaign as a candidate for governor of the province of Buenos Aires.\par \par \uc2 That's why this Monday the market will see what happens in \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2  with the dollar, where there is order to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  with sales from Wednesday and for a week so that the real one does not collapse. This signal is contagious to Argentina. If the Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is dropped, the fate of the Argentine peso will not be very different. The dollar rose in Brazil 9.5% in a month and is worth more 4.02 reais, when on July 18 the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was trading at 3.70 per dollar.\par \par \uc2 KEEP READING:\par \par \uc2 Macri will receive Lacunza and Sandleris in the fifth Los Abrojos on Monday\par \par \uc2 Who's who at the girl table with which Lacunza analyzes her first measurements\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020190819ef8j0021z\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
