\par\par \b \uc2 ANALYSIS- \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  markets on  \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention \highlight\uc2  alert as real slide accelerates\b0\par\par\uc2 746 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Mai 2019\par 19:46\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2019 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 BRASILIA/SAO PAULO, May 17 (Reuters) - The rapid acceleration of the Brazilian real's slide against the dollar this week has put traders on high alert for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stop the rot, although so far there is no sign the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has shown its hand.\par \par \uc2 With messy politics slowing the government's fiscal reform agenda in Congress, the domestic economy deteriorating and global trade war tensions rising, the real has plunged through 4.00 per dollar to its lowest level since September.\par \par \uc2 It has depreciated 3.5% this week, one of its biggest weekly declines since Brazil emerged from a brutal recession in late 2016.\par \par \uc2 A spokesman for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  declined to comment.\par \par \uc2 The last time the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the spot \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market was February 2009. Its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  since then have been in the \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps market where it is routinely active, by adjusting the size and maturity of contracts it rolls over.\par \par \uc2 Market participants say it is inconceivable that policymakers will not be more sensitive than ever to the real's price, liquidity and volatility.\par \par \uc2 "It's a perfect storm for a speculative attack on the real. They (policymakers) will definitely be monitoring this," said a broker in Sao Paulo. "What the market is looking for is the point at which the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  gets uncomfortable."\par \par \uc2 Analysts at Citi reckon that point could be soon. They point to the scale of the real's depreciation in the lead up to three previous episodes of heavy \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  activity in the \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps market around June 2013, May 2017 and May 2018.\par \par \uc2 They note that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's first steps were taken after the real had depreciated by between 9% and 16% (or an average of 12%), and had underperformed a broad index of emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  by 8%-10%.\par \par \uc2 Now, the real is down 11% since early February and has underperformed emerging \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  by 7%, Citi's analysts say.\par \par \uc2 "We may be close to the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  zone," they said in a note to clients on Friday, adding that a dollar spike to 4.10 reais could trigger \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and that a rise to 4.20 would. That first threshold was breached only hours after the note was published on Friday.\par \par \uc2 "\b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  risk has clearly risen. (But) we would note that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has not always put an end to the sell-off," they said.\par \par \uc2 The dollar on Friday rose as high as 4.1125, the highest since September last year, and interest rate futures contracts jumped, particularly contracts a year or more out.\par \par \uc2 Despite the sluggish economy and rising risk of recession calling for lower interest rates, according to a number of economists, the rates market is now discounting 50 basis points of rate hikes to 7.00% by the end of next year. \par \par \par \par \uc2 \f2 In a wide-ranging question-and-answer session with lawmakers on Thursday, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  president \f28 \uc2 \f2 Roberto Campos Neto\f28 \uc2 \f2  said the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  does not have an exchange rate target and believes in flexible \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . Therefore, there is no need for the bank to have a special committee for \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Brazil\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has almost $400 billion of international reserves, so the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has the ammunition to defend the real through selling dollars if it wanted to.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 When the dollar rose to 4.00 reais in late March the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  beefed up its presence in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  swaps market to inject liquidity into the market and ease the selling pressure on the real. The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  was keen to stress, however, that this was not an act of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Yet volatility then was higher than it is now. Implied volatility on one-week dollar/real options contracts reached 19%, and despite rising this week, it is only just above 14% now. To compare, when the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  heavily around May 2017, one-week implied volatility soared above 30%.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 So while the real's slide on the spot market move has been eye-catching, market volatility has been relatively well contained, suggesting the market is still functioning smoothly.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 This will likely be a relief to the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , said Luciano Rostagno, chief strategist for Mizuho do Brasil, adding that a "one week move" is not enough to trigger \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . ($1 = 4.10 reais)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (Reporting by Jamie McGeever and Jose Gomes Neto Editing by Susan Thomas) \f28 \par \par \uc2 Released: 2019-5-17T18:46:56.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020190517ef5h0341d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
