\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  cenbank pauses  \highlight22\uc2 interventions \highlight\uc2  as Trump win boosts volatility\b0\par\par\uc2 477 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 November 2016\par 23:02\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2016 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 (Recasts to include \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announcement)\par \par \uc2 By Bruno Federowski\par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO, Nov 9 (Reuters) - \uc2 Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will not hold any reverse \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swap auctions for a second day on Thursday after performing them almost daily since late last year, it said in a statement.\par \par \uc2 The bank said it will pause its daily auctions of reverse \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps, which function like dollar purchases by investors for future delivery, for at least Thursday to assess "current market conditions."\par \par \uc2 The move comes after U.S. President-elect \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 's surprise victory sent global financial markets into a tailspin overnight and slammed Brazil's real \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  as investors worried that his erratic campaign pledges would trigger months of policy uncertainty.\par \par \uc2 The pause in the auctions marks a setback to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's year-old plan to unload its costly exposure to traditional \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps, equivalent to future dollar sales, after years of meddling left it holding more than $100 billion in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 -linked derivatives late last year.\par \par \uc2 Earlier on Thursday, Reuters reported that traders speculated the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could slow the reduction of traditional swaps if market remained volatile.\par \par \uc2 Before local markets opened, \uc2 Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced it was cancelling an auction of $250 million worth of reverse \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps for Wednesday.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Ilan Goldfajn said the bank was monitoring global markets and would take "adequate measures." He declined to comment directly on the U.S. election.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  resorted to selling reverse \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps in late 2015 as expectations of leftist President \uc2 Dilma Rousseff\uc2 's impeachment triggered a rally in the real.\par \par \uc2 That allowed it to reduce the balance of traditional swaps to $24 billion by Wednesday's close.\par \par \uc2 Even without \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday, the real weakened as much as 2.5 percent to nearly 3.25 per U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is signaling that the pace of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from now on will depend on whether volatility dies down," said Roberto Campos, who manages 1.3 billion reais as a partner at S\u227\'00\'E3o Paulo-based Absolute Investimentos.\par \par \uc2 Should swings in the real continue, traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could struggle to resume sales of reverse swaps.\par \par \uc2 Additional volatility is far from certain.\par \par \uc2 Traders pointed to Trump's conciliatory acceptance speech as a sign that aggressive campaign rhetoric could give way to more constructive policymaking. That helped the real fight back to close at 3.21 to the dollar.\par \par \uc2 Even if Trump enacts protectionist policies, some analysts believe the impact in Brazil will be limited.\par \par \uc2 "My base case scenario is that today was a one-off event," Cristiano Oliveira, chief economist at Banco Fibra, said. (Reporting by Bruno Federowski; Writing by Brad Haynes; Editing by Daniel Flynn and Alan Crosby)\par \par \uc2 Released: 2016-11-12T22:02:18.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020161109ecb9013cp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
